rrier with the same MLIP, as a cross-check of E_m. (c) Validation first: recover LiF's measured melting point (~1121 K) with a solid-liquid coexistence run using the same model, and the lattice constant/density, before trusting any transport number. Uncertainty would cover seed-to-seed scatter, MSD-fit window and finite-size effects, but not systematic MLIP error beyond what (c) bounds.",
